Output examples/recordings/rust_basic_memory.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20

Type "# Aetheris-MemOS: Rust SDK - Basic Memory Operations"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "cd sdks/rust && cargo run --example basic_memory"
Enter
Sleep 15s
